{"parse": {"title": "Sound Sealed Star", "pageid": 1571, "revid": 9132, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 85px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/76/Sound_Sealed_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20221009233135\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Sound Sealed Star\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/76/Sound_Sealed_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20221009233135\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Sound Sealed Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Sound_Sealed_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><i>The Sound Sealed Star</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Sound Sealed Star</b>, added in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_6_-_Jujutsu_Kaisen_Update_Part_1\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 6</a>, is a reward obtained from reaching Room 100 in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Infinity Castle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5maW5pdHlfQ2FzdGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Infinity Castle</span> (1st Season). This item has become <b>unobtainable</b> as of Update 7.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"color:#FFC208;\">+Required to obtain a special unit...</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#921296;\"><i>\"Things are going to get real flashy!\"</i></span></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span style=\"color:#fc4242;\">This Star is sealed with a powerful magic and cannot be opened yet...</span> (Prior to Update 7)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-sty